      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just discovered that breaking these variables up into more objects actually *helps*, so having 120 objects with one string instead of 30 objects with 4 strings does not cause log spam. However, strings over 128 characters still do not sync correctly and actually break syncing altogether.",
      "viewerReactions": null
